When wearing a ring of teleportation I attacked a floating eye and
got frozen by its gaze. I then started to be teleported about while
still frozen.

1) should you still be frozen by the gaze when you've been teleported
   away ???

2) if you then happen to land in a shop should you be able to pick up
   what you land on -- what happened was I landed in the shop, automatically
   picked up what I landed on, then while still frozen got teleported out
   of the shop and rapidly got killed by a bunch of Kops.

I suggested you should be able to move as soon as you can no longer
see the eye (i.e. get teleported away). In any case you should not be
able to pick objects up when frozen (especially in shops :-)

